{"include_website_name is missing the ? suffix that every other conditional-inclusion guard in the file uses. Depending on the ActiveModelSerializers version, the non-? form may not be recognised and the attribute could be serialised unconditionally even when website is blank.": 0.45419785380363464, "URI(website.to_s) is parsed up to three times within a single call to website_name - once for .host and again for .path. The rescue nil only guards the first parse; subsequent calls would raise unguarded. Should store the parsed URI in a local variable once.": 0.4670003652572632, "Missing test for sibling-subdomain case (Case 2) - the website_name method has three distinct branches but the sibling-subdomain branch (e.g. www.example.com as the website host on a forum.example.com Discourse instance) has no corresponding test.": 0.8057038187980652}